Dimension: Design
Severity: Major
Location: spring-ai-model/src/main/java/org/springframework/ai/model/tool/DefaultToolCallingChatOptions.java::235
Title: Fragile instanceof check in combineWith
Description: The combineWith method uses an instanceof check to handle merging. If a new type of ChatOptions.Builder is added, this code must be modified, violating the Open/Closed Principle.
Assumption: The system will need to support multiple concrete builder implementations in the future.

